        "optional": false,
        "purpose": "SUPERSEDES the return type of RequirementIds.parse declared in this sketch ({ epicHash; ordinal; storyId? }): a stored requirement id carries only the date and the first 8 hash characters, so parse returns these parts, story and fr as numbers"
